<title>FINLAND: Rauma sees good full-year 96 profitability.</title>
<headline>Rauma sees good full-year 96 profitability.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering group Rauma Oy on Thursday repeated it expected profitability for 1996 to be good.</p>
<p>&quot;Despite a lower than expected order intake, Rauma's profitability for the entire year is expected to be good,&quot; it said in a statement with its January-August results.</p>
<p>Rauma posted a 671 million markka profit before extraordinary items in 1995.</p>
<p>In January-August, the group's profit rose 16 percent on the year-ago period to 427 million markka.</p>
</text>
